---
import Card from './ui/Card.astro';
import Badge from './ui/Badge.astro';
import Sticker from './ui/Sticker.astro';
---
<section id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-heading" class="border-b-4 border-ink pb-10 md:pb-16">
  <div class="mb-10" data-reveal><h2 id="experience-heading" class="mt-6 inline-block -rotate-1 rounded-2xl border-4 border-ink bg-badge-yellow px-5 py-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink-strong shadow-hard">What I’ve been up to</h2></div>
  <div class="relative space-y-12">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute bottom-0 left-[0.6rem] top-0 w-1 rounded bg-ink/20 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2"></div>
    <div id="exp-edward-jones" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0ms" class="relative pl-10 md:pl-0 md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] md:mr-auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[0.05rem] top-8 h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-4 border-ink bg-accent shadow-hard md:left-auto md:top-10 md:-right-[2.9rem]"></span><Card class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><Badge label="Nov 2022 – Present" color="blue" class="mb-4 self-start" /><h3 class="text-xl font-black">Engineer III</h3><p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted"><span>Edward Jones</span><span class="text-ink" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>St. Louis, MO (Remote)</span></p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Became the de facto expert on a legacy document platform after its SME passed away — reverse-engineered 2 data centers, 50 servers, and 6 dependent apps of undocumented architecture, then built the DR plan it never had. Also the unofficial 24/7 support, which is a fancy way of saying my phone is always on.</p></Card></div>
    <div id="exp-purple-guys" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms" class="relative pl-10 md:pl-0 md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] md:ml-auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[0.05rem] top-8 h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-4 border-ink bg-accent shadow-hard md:left-auto md:top-10 md:-left-[2.9rem]"></span><Card class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><Badge label="Mar 2022 – Aug 2022" color="purple" class="mb-4 self-start" /><h3 class="text-xl font-black">Field Systems Analyst II</h3><p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted"><span>The Purple Guys</span><span class="text-ink" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Kansas City, KS</span></p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">MSP life. I designed, implemented, and maintained IT systems and infrastructure while handling network, security, hardware, and software configurations across Windows and macOS environments for more than 30 SMB clients. I was the point of escalation anytime something was extra broken.</p></Card></div>
    <div id="exp-university-of-kansas" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0ms" class="relative pl-10 md:pl-0 md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] md:mr-auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[0.05rem] top-8 h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-4 border-ink bg-accent shadow-hard md:left-auto md:top-10 md:-right-[2.9rem]"></span><Card class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><Badge label="Jul 2018 – Mar 2022" color="green" class="mb-4 self-start" /><h3 class="text-xl font-black">Senior IT Support Technician</h3><p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted"><span>University of Kansas</span><span class="text-ink" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Lawrence, KS</span></p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Led imaging and deployment for up to 60 workstations across 4 departments, supporting 100+ faculty and grad TAs. Owned the full workstation lifecycle across Windows, Linux, and macOS — licensing, repair, inventory, and the eternal refresh planning.</p></Card></div>
    <div id="exp-bestmacs" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms" class="relative pl-10 md:pl-0 md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] md:ml-auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[0.05rem] top-8 h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-4 border-ink bg-accent shadow-hard md:left-auto md:top-10 md:-left-[2.9rem]"></span><Card class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><Badge label="May 2017 – Jul 2018" color="yellow" class="mb-4 self-start" /><h3 class="text-xl font-black">IT Specialist</h3><p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted"><span>BestMacs</span><span class="text-ink" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Lawrence, KS</span></p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Built 3-2-1 backup strategies with regular audits and kept the VPN, videoconferencing, and remote-work stack running for 20+ SMB clients. Also the person pre-sales clients got when they needed an entire stack designed before signing.</p></Card></div>
    <div id="exp-apple" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0ms" class="relative pl-10 md:pl-0 md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] md:mr-auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[0.05rem] top-8 h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-4 border-ink bg-accent shadow-hard md:left-auto md:top-10 md:-right-[2.9rem]"></span><Card class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><Badge label="Mar 2012 – May 2017" color="pink" class="mb-4 self-start" /><h3 class="text-xl font-black">Senior AppleCare Advisor, Mac+</h3><p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted"><span>Apple Inc</span><span class="text-ink" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Cupertino, CA (Remote)</span></p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Five years of advanced iOS/macOS troubleshooting with real diagnostic-log root-cause analysis, 3 live cases at once — the original incident triage training. Also wrote the docs and training content nobody else volunteered for.</p></Card></div>
        <div data-reveal class="relative pl-10 md:pl-0 md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] md:ml-auto"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[0.05rem] top-8 h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-4 border-ink bg-accent shadow-hard md:left-auto md:top-10 md:-left-[2.9rem]"></span><Card class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col border-accent bg-accent/20"><Badge label="Available for Work" color="pink" class="mb-4 self-start bg-transparent !text-ink" /><h3 class="text-xl font-black">Hire me before your competitor does!</h3><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">I’m nice, smart, and funny. I’ve got a real love for technology and all of the things that make it tick. Together, we can save the world — one line of code at a time.</p><Sticker class="absolute -right-4 -top-5" color="primary" rotate="7">Your name here!</Sticker></Card></div>
  </div>
</section>
